    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You accepted an invitation to join the Harpers and swore to uphold their code and serve the common good. Like every Harper, you know the value of teamwork, and also when it is better to act alone. Veteran Harpers taught you the order's secrets—magical melodies, coded watchwords, and sleight of hand—and trust you to use them to watch and thwart the forces of evil.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.DEypZy4hrFbV1vPy]{Harper Agent}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Performance and Sleight of Hand</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulDisguiseKi]{Disguise Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulDisguiseKi]{Disguise Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCostume0000]{Costume}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagGrapplingHo]{Grappling Hook}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 14 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
